<title>AUSTRALIA: Costello says low rates, budget key to future.</title>
<headline>Costello says low rates, budget key to future.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Thursday low interest rates and a solid budget plan were the cornerstones for economic growth prospects.</p>
<p>&quot;Low interest rates and a concrete and responsible fiscal plan are the cornerstones which we believe underpin our future growth and economic prospects,&quot; Costello said in a speech to the Economic Society of Australia in Melbourne.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
